<p id="requirements">
	<strong>Requirements:</strong> VetPress needs WordPress 7.1 or newer and PHP 8.3 or newer. You can check both in <strong>Tools &gt; Site Health &gt; Info</strong>: the WordPress version is under <strong>WordPress</strong> and the PHP version under <strong>Server</strong>. If your PHP version is lower, change it in your hosting control panel or ask your host to do it. WordPress won't install the theme on an older version.
</p>
